# Extends the s34 diplomacy round-trip: title → single player → load → lastturn →
# confirm → strategic map → DIPLOMACY tab (screen 0x0b), then the NEW gift flow:
#   1. click the GIFT action button (top of the roster's action strip, retail
#      DAT_004dd940 rec0 → FUN_00436141 → screen 0x1a mode 0).  Button sprite
#      0x40 at (0x190,0x66)=(400,102); click game (412,114) → l=(114<<16)|412.
#      Type-5 press-latch (quirk #219) → the port's 0x0b router arm opens the
#      gift screen off the action flag.  The gift panel (engine_diplomacy_action.c
#      FUN_00417960) draws over a recomposited map: "gift to <partner>", the
#      partner's standing offer, the staged amount (0 Crowns), a prompt + the
#      ±10 arrows and Yes/No seals.
#   2. click the UP amount arrow (rec0 at (0xb8,0xf0)=(184,240), type 4,
#      FUN_00436372 param 1) → stage +10 Crowns.  Click game (194,250).
#   3. click the YES seal (rec2 at (0x120,0x118)=(288,280), sprite 0x1d, type 5,
#      FUN_00436408 param 1) → enqueue the gift + transfer the gold
#      (engine_diplomacy_queue_action = FUN_004a2621: local gold −10, partner
#      +10, inbox entry) → close to the MAP.  Click game (300,292).
